      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Exactly the same thing in the Prompt or Die World, even on open beta:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_83f5544b-66ba-4baf-a5aa-4fecc5b6b780\n\n- disabling avatar scaling in world settings doesn't make a difference\n\n- I am NOT setting avatar height in code anywhere (I do use the height change event for 2 in-world objects)\n\nUnsure what else could be isolated.\n\nI had one case where an avatar would blow up while in the idle pose (gradually scale up). So some avatars just flat out break in these affected worlds. Non affected worlds display the avatars completely fine.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
